-- Trained on Google's Quick, Draw! dataset (CC BY 4.0).
-- Additional custom labels use hand-reviewed procedural doodles; synthetic accuracy is an upper bound.
-- Also trained with offline FLUX.1-schnell outputs (Apache-2.0), filtered by frozen SigLIP; not player drawings.
return {
	name = "long299_64_v4_s001846975",
	size = 64,
	inputChannels = 4,
